/Alt (The six panel line graph is arranged in two columns of three rows, displaying supply and user data for NG, AG, and LPG from 2014 to 2023. Each panel includes three lines: Actual, GM\(1,1\), and GM-Markov. The horizontal axis for all panels represents years from 2014 to 2023. The vertical axis values vary per panel. Panel a, NG Supply, shows all three lines increasing steadily from approximately 1000 in 2014 to 1800 in 2023. Panel b, NG Users, shows all three lines increasing steadily from approximately 25000 in 2014 to 45000 in 2023. Panel c, AG Supply, shows all three lines decreasing from approximately 60 in 2014 to 15 in 2023, with a slight increase around 2017 to 2018. Panel d, AG Users, shows all three lines decreasing from approximately 1800 in 2014 to 200 in 2023. Panel e, LPG Supply, shows all three lines fluctuating, starting around 1050 in 2014, peaking around 1100 in 2015, then generally decreasing to approximately 750 in 2023. Panel f, LPG Users, shows all three lines decreasing steadily from approximately 14000 in 2014 to 9000 in 2023.)
